---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer id="contatti" class="overflow-hidden bg-brand-mint pb-0 text-brand-deep mx-auto w-shell rounded-[20px] p-panel tablet:rounded-3xl" aria-labelledby="contacts-title">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-7 pb-8 tablet:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.4fr] tablet:gap-12 tablet:pb-12">
        <div class="[&>h2]:mb-5 tablet:[&>h2]:mb-6 [&>p]:text-sm tablet:[&>p]:text-base [&>p]:leading-[1.6] tablet:[&>p]:leading-[1.6] [&>p+p]:mt-1">
          <h2 id="contacts-title" class="font-medium tracking-[-0.035em] [text-wrap:pretty] text-section-title leading-[1.15] data-[visible=true]:animate-settle motion-reduce:!animate-none" data-reveal>Contatti</h2>
          <p class="data-[visible=true]:animate-settle motion-reduce:!animate-none" data-reveal>Dott.ssa Ilaria Mezzanotti</p>
          <p class="data-[visible=true]:animate-settle motion-reduce:!animate-none" data-reveal>Psicologa e Psicoterapeuta</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid content-start grid-cols-1 gap-2 wide:grid-cols-2 wide:gap-x-8">
          <a class="flex min-h-11 w-fit max-w-full items-center gap-3 text-sm leading-[1.6] hover:translate-x-1 hover:underline hover:underline-offset-4 tablet:gap-4 tablet:text-base tablet:leading-[1.6] [&>i]:w-6 [&>i]:shrink-0 [&>i]:text-center [&>i]:text-[21px] [&>span]:[overflow-wrap:anywhere] data-[visible=true]:animate-settle motion-reduce:!animate-none" data-reveal href="tel:+393663712597"
            ><i class="fa-solid fa-phone" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>366 3712597</span></a
          >
          <a class="flex min-h-11 w-fit max-w-full items-center gap-3 text-sm leading-[1.6] hover:translate-x-1 hover:underline hover:underline-offset-4 tablet:gap-4 tablet:text-base tablet:leading-[1.6] [&>i]:w-6 [&>i]:shrink-0 [&>i]:text-center [&>i]:text-[21px] [&>span]:[overflow-wrap:anywhere] data-[visible=true]:animate-settle motion-reduce:!animate-none" data-reveal href="mailto:ilaria.mezzanotti@gmail.com"
            ><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope" aria-hidden="true"></i
            ><span>ilaria.mezzanotti@gmail.com</span></a
          >
          <a
            class="flex min-h-11 w-fit max-w-full items-center gap-3 text-sm leading-[1.6] hover:translate-x-1 hover:underline hover:underline-offset-4 tablet:gap-4 tablet:text-base tablet:leading-[1.6] [&>i]:w-6 [&>i]:shrink-0 [&>i]:text-center [&>i]:text-[21px] [&>span]:[overflow-wrap:anywhere] data-[visible=true]:animate-settle motion-reduce:!animate-none" data-reveal
            href="https://www.facebook.com/ilaria.mezzanotti.3"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            ><i class="fab fa-facebook" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Ilaria Mezzanotti</span></a
          >
          <a
            class="flex min-h-11 w-fit max-w-full items-center gap-3 text-sm leading-[1.6] hover:translate-x-1 hover:underline hover:underline-offset-4 tablet:gap-4 tablet:text-base tablet:leading-[1.6] [&>i]:w-6 [&>i]:shrink-0 [&>i]:text-center [&>i]:text-[21px] [&>span]:[overflow-wrap:anywhere] data-[visible=true]:animate-settle motion-reduce:!animate-none" data-reveal
            href="https://www.instagram.com/ilaria.mezzanotti_psicologa/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            ><i class="fab fa-instagram" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>ilaria.mezzanotti_psicologa</span></a
          >
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="-mx-panel bg-brand-green px-panel py-5 text-brand-deep desktop:flex desktop:items-baseline desktop:justify-between desktop:gap-8 [&>small]:text-[13px] [&>small]:leading-[1.7] tablet:[&>small]:leading-[1.6] desktop:[&>small]:shrink-0">
        <small>© <span id="year">{currentYear}</span> Ilaria Mezzanotti. Tutti i diritti riservati.</small>
        <details id="cookie-policy" class="group mt-5 desktop:mt-0 desktop:min-w-0 desktop:max-w-[50%]">
        <summary class="flex min-h-11 w-fit cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-2.5 text-sm font-medium leading-[1.6] desktop:ml-auto desktop:items-baseline focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[3px] focus-visible:outline-brand-deep focus-visible:outline-offset-4 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-cookie-bite" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          Cookie Policy
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-xs transition-transform duration-[180ms] group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </summary>
        <p class="  max-w-[60ch] pt-3 text-sm leading-[1.75]">
          Questo sito utilizza esclusivamente cookie tecnici necessari al funzionamento e non raccoglie
          dati personali degli utenti. Non vengono utilizzati cookie di profilazione né strumenti di
          tracciamento di terze parti.
        </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </footer>
